{
 "meta": {
  "lane": "a",
  "task": "t119",
  "chunk": "a/013",
  "family": "JUG"
 },
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "u04948",
   "en": "Say what you want, Williams. If you were calling the shots, you'd have done the same. Alenko would've, too.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04949",
   "en": "The mission was never in danger. I had it all under control.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04950",
   "en": "No one gets left behind. Not while I'm in charge.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04951",
   "en": "This mission isn't over yet. We still have to find the Conduit before Saren does.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04952",
   "en": "I won't accept failure. This mission is too important. Saren's still looking for the Conduit. But we're going to find it first!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04953",
   "en": "Williams knew the risks going in. She gave her life to save the rest of us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04954",
   "en": "We had to leave her behind. Saren has to be stopped. At any cost.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04955",
   "en": "There was no time. I couldn't save you both. The bomb was about to go off.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04956",
   "en": "I'm sorry, Kaidan. I'd never leave you behind. I couldn't. You know that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04957",
   "en": "Lieutenant Alenko, I am your commanding officer! I did what I had to do. Don't question my orders!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04958",
   "en": "It wasn't your call, Alenko. I had to choose. I chose you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04959",
   "en": "It wasn't your fault. It wasn't my fault. The only one to blame here is Saren.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04960",
   "en": "Get it together, soldier! Ash's blood is on Saren's hands. And when we find that son-of-a-bitch, I'll make him pay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04961",
   "en": "Williams is dead. We can't change that. But if we don't stop Saren, her sacrifice was made in vain.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04962",
   "en": "Alenko knew the risks going in. He gave his life to save the rest of us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04963",
   "en": "We had to leave him behind. Saren has to be stopped. At any cost.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04964",
   "en": "I'm sorry, Ash. I'd never leave you behind. I couldn't. You know that.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04965",
   "en": "Chief Williams, I am your commanding officer! I did what I had to do. Don't question my orders!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04966",
   "en": "It wasn't your call, Williams. I had to choose. I chose you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04967",
   "en": "Get it together, soldier! Kaidan's blood is on Saren's hands. And when we find that son-of-a-bitch, I'll make him pay.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04968",
   "en": "Alenko's dead. We can't change that. But if we don't stop Saren, his sacrifice was made in vain.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04969",
   "en": "You want to join our minds again, don't you? Okay. Go ahead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04970",
   "en": "Nobody is messing with my head anymore! I'm sick of dealing with these visions!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04971",
   "en": "Looks like I don't have a choice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04972",
   "en": "It's worth a shot.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04973",
   "en": "We don't have a moment. Snap out of it and tell me what you saw!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04974",
   "en": "Did the vision make any sense to you?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04975",
   "en": "What about the Conduit?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_LOS40_05_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04976",
   "en": "Are you sure it was the joining? I feel fine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04977",
   "en": "Dr. Chakwas should take a look at you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04978",
   "en": "We're done here. Dismissed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04979",
   "en": "The vision changed. But it's still not clear.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04980",
   "en": "I'll let Joker know where we're headed. Dismissed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04981",
   "en": "It's still not clear. And we've only got one lead left: the Atremis Tau cluster. Crew... dismissed!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04982",
   "en": "Something's different, but I still can't figure it out. And we're down to our last lead. Time to head for the Artemis Tau cluster. Crew... dismissed!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04983",
   "en": "He was a good soldier.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04984",
   "en": "The mission can't fail!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04985",
   "en": "It was you or him.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04986",
   "en": "I'd never leave you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04987",
   "en": "It was my decision.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA20_10C_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04988",
   "en": "Don't blame yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04989",
   "en": "We will avenge him!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04990",
   "en": "We have to go on.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04991",
   "en": "I'm willing to try.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04992",
   "en": "Forget it!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04993",
   "en": "Do it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_UNC82_02_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04994",
   "en": "Fine.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_PRO10_08_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04995",
   "en": "Hurry up!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04996",
   "en": "What did you see?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04997",
   "en": "Anything else?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA20_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04998",
   "en": "That's it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_11_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u04999",
   "en": "It didn't tire me out.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05000",
   "en": "Go ahead.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_03_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05001",
   "en": "Something's different.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05002",
   "en": "I'm not sure.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_07wake_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05003",
   "en": "The vision changed.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05004",
   "en": "You wouldn't have.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05005",
   "en": "I knew what I was doing.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05006",
   "en": "Not an option.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05007",
   "en": "Saren's still out there.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05008",
   "en": "We can't fail!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05009",
   "en": "She was a good soldier.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05010",
   "en": "It was you or her.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05011",
   "en": "We will avenge her!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05012",
   "en": "Commander, there's a comm buoy nearby. I can link us in if you want to report back to the Citadel Council. You know, to warn them about Sovereign.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05013",
   "en": "Patching it through.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05014",
   "en": "Aye, aye, Commander. Sovereign will be sitting on the Citadel's roof before those bastards listen to us.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05015",
   "en": "Set the link up, Joker. They need to know.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05016",
   "en": "They're not going to believe any of this. Not without proof. We'd just be wasting our time.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05017",
   "en": "I'll tell them.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05018",
   "en": "Why bother?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05019",
   "en": "There were other images. Locations. Places I recognized from my research... Ilos! The Conduit is on Ilos!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05020",
   "en": "That is why Saren needed to find the Mu Relay! It is the only way to get to Ilos.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05021",
   "en": "The Mu Relay links to dozens of systems and hundreds of worlds. How was I to know Ilos was the one we wanted?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05022",
   "en": "Without the Cipher, the images in your visions were never clear. Only now do I recognize them as landmarks from Ilos.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05023",
   "en": "Forget it. The Mu Relay's inside the Terminus Systems. Alliance ships are not welcome there. Neither are Spectres.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05024",
   "en": "I've never heard that name before.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05025",
   "en": "Never heard of it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05026",
   "en": "I'm not familiar with that planet.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05027",
   "en": "I am not surprised. Ilos is in a region of space accessible only through the Mu Relay. But the Mu Relay was lost thousands of years ago. Nobody knows where it is.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05028",
   "en": "I recognized some of the landmarks from photos and vids I'd seen during my research. I know of Ilos. I just do not know where it is.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05029",
   "en": "Its original coordinates would place it deep inside the Terminus Systems. Unfortunately, a star in one of the nearby systems went nova roughly four thousand years ago.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05030",
   "en": "The shockwave sent the relay trillions of kilometers off course. Then the dust and radiation from the exploding star engulfed that entire region in a dense nebula cloud.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05031",
   "en": "Finding any object in space is difficult. Finding the Mu Relay inside a nebula cloud is virtually impossible. It would take decades.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05032",
   "en": "I am afraid so. Unless you somehow find the coordinates for the Mu Relay. Then it would be possible to-- ohhh!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05033",
   "en": "How come you never told us about Ilos before?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05034",
   "en": "We need to get to Ilos!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05035",
   "en": "The Conduit's on Ilos. That's where Saren is heading. I'll be waiting for him when he gets there!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05036",
   "en": "If nobody's ever been there, how did you recognize Ilos from my visions?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05037",
   "en": "How do you lose a mass relay?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05038",
   "en": "Are you saying it's hopeless?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05039",
   "en": "This is important.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_STA20_07A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05040",
   "en": "You never mentioned this.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05041",
   "en": "Let's go!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05042",
   "en": "Time's short!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05043",
   "en": "We'll be careful.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05044",
   "en": "That won't stop me!",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05045",
   "en": "We have no choice.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05047",
   "en": "Mu Relay",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05048",
   "en": "So we can't find it?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05049",
   "en": "Time's wasting.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05050",
   "en": "That's not fair.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05051",
   "en": "Aye, aye, Shepard.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05052",
   "en": "Ash, how far are you going to drive yourself? Are you trying to be a martyr? To redeem your grandfather's honor?",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05053",
   "en": "The hell it isn't. I don't want a marine with a death wish covering my back. Get over it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05054",
   "en": "What the public and the military did to him was unfair. But I don't want to lose you because of it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05055",
   "en": "What the public and the military did to him was unfair. But I don't want to lose a good soldier over it.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05056",
   "en": "Don't sacrifice yourself.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05057",
   "en": "I don't want to lose you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05058",
   "en": "We need you.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06lockera_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05059",
   "en": "Bull.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_06kaidan_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05060",
   "en": "But it's true.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "u05061",
   "en": "Yes, ma'am. I'm-- We'll get it done.",
   "tr": "",
   "ctx": [
    "BIOA_JUG_80_X_Outrun_CIN_LOC",
    "BIOA_NOR10_04A_DSG_LOC"
   ]
  }
 ]
}
